Bundle-Name: Fennec Model Atlas - EObject Registry Provider
Bundle-Description: Generic Model Atlas content source for the emf.osgi EObject registry: \
 syncs the objects of configured atlas registries into a named EObjectRegistry through its \
 writer face - resiliently, with retry, periodic refresh and identity-compare-friendly \
 pushes (the atlas client's ETag cache returns identical instances for unchanged objects). \
 Deliberately a writer client, not an initial provider: registry publication must never \
 depend on the network.

-workingset: ModelAtlas

-library: enableEMF

-buildpath: \
	org.eclipse.fennec.model.atlas.scope.api;version=latest,\
	org.eclipse.fennec.emf.osgi.eobject.registry;version=latest

-testpath: \
	assertj-core;version=latest
